*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.svg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.avi binary
*.zip binary
*.rar binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.a binary
*.obj binary
*.bin binary
